QuestGuidance.Register("en",278,{
[8865]="7006907E\n1\tComplete Mission: Ship of Wraiths\tYour mission is to investigate what happened in the Shedax Khîn in the Shield Isles, and rescue any trapped sailors. Speak to Deshra to travel.\n2\tTalk to Deshra\tYou have defeated the dead and rescued the prisoners! Return with the Umbari scout to the mission giver with this report.\n",
[8866]="70062BEB\n1\tDefeat the occupying forces at Sírlond\t\n2\tDefeat the occupying forces at Sírlond\t\n3\tFind the scout\t\n",
[8867]="70062C73\n1\tComplete the Mission: Siege of Sírlond\tSpeak with the mission giver when you are ready to travel to Sírlond and retake the outpost from the Orc menace.\n2\tReturn to the mission giver and tell them of your success\tYour mission was a success, you should return to the mission giver and tell them of your success.\n",
[8868]="7005CACC\n1\tDefend the watch-tower\tDefend the watch-tower.\n2\tClear the enemy encampment below the watch-tower\tClear the enemy encampment below the watch-tower.\n",
[8869]="7005CACF\n1\tComplete Mission: Siege of the Rift\tYour mission is to protect the Elves left to guard the entrance to The Rift. Speak to Hórin to travel.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8870]="70062FBD\n1\tDestroy White Hand siege towers (total: 4)\030Destroy White Hand catapults (total: 6)\t\n2\tFind the scout\t\n",
[8871]="70062FCB\n1\tComplete the Mission: Siege-breaking\tYou are to go to the Uruk encampment, destroy the siege equipment they have, and make ready for war.\n2\tTalk to Hithriel\tNow that you have destroyed the siege weaponry at the Uruk encampment, you should return to the mission giver and tell them of your victory.\n",
[8872]="70062FC3\n1\tAcquire Elven relics (total: 12)\030Eliminate the Uruk-hai in the ruins (total: 8)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8873]="70062FCD\n1\tComplete the Mission: Sifting Through Time\tA rescue mission, not of the living, but of the historical items of the Elves. Speak with the mission giver to go to the ruins and retrieve the ancient bits of Elven history from the White Hand Uruks.\n2\tTalk to Hithriel\tYou retrieved the relics and handed them to the scout who arrived to lead you out. Return to the mission giver and tell them of your efforts.\n",
[8874]="70062FBF\n1\tDestroy White Hand banners (total: 10)\030Eliminate Uruk invaders (total: 8)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8875]="7006330E\n1\tComplete the Mission: Signs and Sigils\tYou are to make your way into the ruins of Caras Gelebren, tear down the banners of the White Hand and slay as many Uruk-hai as you find. Speak with the mission giver to undertake this mission.\n2\tSpeak with the mission giver\tYou found a good number of Uruk-hai in the ruins and destroys the banners you found. Return now to receive your rewards.\n",
[8876]="70057F84\n1\tDefeat Maukhuk, son of Ránulur\tFind and defeat Maukhuk, son of Ránulur. He can be found inside Shathur-munzu.\n",
[8877]="70057F8E\n1\tComplete Mission: Son of the Chieftain\tYour mission is to find and defeat Maukhuk, a fearsome warg pack-leader. Speak to Hórin to travel to Shathur-munzu.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8878]="70072E99\n1\tComplete Mission: Song of Rest\tYour mission is to search the Crypts of Gadim-ûn for the source of the evil that has caused the dead to rise. Talk to Têsegi when you are ready to travel.\n2\tTalk to Têsegi Jiret-menêsh\tYou have determined the source of the evil that has caused the dead to rise in the Crypts of Gadim-ûn. Return with the Temámir scout to report your success.\n",
[8879]="7006E4D2\n1\tComplete Mission: Spiders in the Quarry\tMonstrous spiders have taken over the quarry in Scary. You have been asked to help deal with the problem before the spiders have the chance to move on the town.\n2\tTalk to the Hooded Stranger in The Prancing Pony\tYou have defeated the spiders that flooded into the Scary quarry. You should talk to the Hooded Stranger about your reward.\n",
[8880]="70059853\n1\tPlant banners on defeated Orcs in the Dimrill Dale (total: 12)\tYour mission is to defeat Orcs in the Dimrill Dale and plant banners of the Gabil'akkâ upon them.\n",
[8881]="7005985F\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Standards of Khazad-dûm'\tYour mission is to defeat Orcs in the Dimrill Dale and plant banners of the Gabil'akkâ upon them. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and travel to the Dimrill Dale.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar.\n",
[8882]="70062D11\n1\tComplete the Mission: Starve them Out\tOrdered by the taskmaster at Gramsfoot, you are to make your way to Hoarhallow and steal the feed sacks that the Hobbits keep laying around.\n2\tReturn to Uglash at Gramsfoot\tHaving stolen a good number of the feedbags you should return to Uglash at Gramsfoot and claim your reward.\n",
[8883]="70062D02\n1\tSteal Hobbit Feed Sacks (total: 12)\t\n",
[8884]="7005C980\n1\tDefeat Frost-horde drake emissaries (total: 4)\030Destroy Angmarim coffers (total: 10)\tYou should defeat Frost-horde drake emissaries and destroy Angmarim coffers found throughout the area.\n2\tYou should regroup at the bottom of the stairs where the mission began\tYou should regroup at the bottom of the stairs where the mission began.\n",
[8885]="7005C981\n1\tComplete Mission: Stepping into the Drearspire\tYou have been tasked with defeating Frost-horde drake emissaries and destroying Angmarim coffers. Speak to Ausma to travel to the Drearspire.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8886]="70062BF1\n1\tReach the small encampment at the top of Caranost's stairs\tFurther into the ruins of Caranost you find more Orcs. In order to assist the Free Peoples, you must continue to drive them out and reach the top of the stairs at Caranost.\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8887]="70062C70\n1\tComplete the Mission: Steps of Caranost\tTell the mission giver that you wish to take the fight up the stairs of Caranost to drive the Orc enemy from the ruin.\n2\tTalk to Baglan\tYou have taken the steps and can return to the mission giver with news of your victory.\n",
[8888]="7005C536\n1\tComplete Mission: Sting Like a Grodbog\tYour mission is to retrieve grodbog mucous and poison glands from within the grodbog hive. Speak to Ausma to travel to the grodbog hive.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8889]="7005C537\n1\tCollect grodbog mucous (total: 13)\030Extract poison glands from gredbyg (total: 8)\tCollect grodbog mucous, and extract grodbog poison glands within the grodbog hive.\n2\tReturn to the entrance of the hive\tYou should return to the entrance of the hive.\n",
[8890]="700622EB\n1\tDiscover and destroy the source of evil in the ruins\tDiscover the evil within the ruins and destroy it.\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8891]="700622EF\n1\tComplete the Mission: Stirring of Spirits\tSpeak with the mission giver and let them know that you are ready to investigate the ruins.\n2\tReturn to the mission giver and tell them of your findings\tWith your mission in the ruins successful, you should return to the mission giver and tell them of your findings.\n",
[8892]="70062FB9\n1\tEscort the post-worker across the Ford\t\n",
[8893]="70063030\n1\tComplete the Mission: Stirring at Sarn Ford\tThe post coming out of the Shire proper has slowed to a crawl because of something that has upset the deliverer responsible for crossing the ford. You are asked to speak with the mission giver to investigate.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tSomething was stirred in the wake of riders crossing the ford. You assisted the post-person in crossing the ford and now normal delivery resumes. Return to the mission giver and inform them of what transpired.\n",
[8894]="7005C9A6\n1\tDefeat Stûg-and-Zar\tYou should defeat the fearsome troll Stûg-and-Zar.\n2\tRegroup near the entrance to the cave\tYou should regroup near the entrance to the cave.\n",
[8895]="7005C9A7\n1\tComplete Mission: Stomping Stûg-and-Zar\tYou have been tasked with defeating the dreaded two-headed troll Stûg-and-Zar. Speak to Ausma to travel to seek out the creature.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8896]="7006C53F\n1\tComplete Mission: Stop the Production\tYour mission is to travel to Zikrum-dûl to defeat the apothecaries and their leader, as well as destroy their workstations. Speak to Ashâmi to travel.\n2\tTalk to Ashâmi\tYou have successfully eliminated Samûku and the apothecaries as well as destroyed their workstations. Return with the scout to Ashâmi with this report.\n",
